Cell["\<\
Comparison radial velocity homoclinic orbit and critical plunge. Both type of \
motion can be represent by the same function.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.981793705865335*^9, 3.981793712568507*^9}, {
  3.9817939803630257`*^9, 
